      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah that makes sense. i have been super stressed lately with work. i also noticed my jaw feels a bit tight like i've been clenching it in my sleep. do you think i should just take some ibuprofen or maybe try a heating pad to see if it goes away? i really don't want to go to the doctor if i don't have to, it seems like overkill for just a jaw ache.",
